{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Omelet You Cook</strong> is a  wacky arcade roguelike where your cooking skills are put to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/OmeletCycling.gif?t=1744205177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect omelet by combining ingredients to meet the ever-growing demands of quirky customers. Each round brings new challenges, hazards, restrictions, and ever-increasing score thresholds, that will push your culinary creativity to its limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/cards-steam.png?t=1744205177\" />Every customer has a distinct personality and unique tastes, so you\u2019ll need to stay versatile and adjust your recipes on the fly. One minute you're crafting a classic bellpepper and bacon omelet, and the next you're tossing in donuts, pickles and pineapple. Keep your cool and keep those omelets coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Omelet You Cook is created by two indie devs and draws inspiration from beloved arcade roguelikes like <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Luck Be a Landlord</i>, and <i>Ballionaire</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feature List:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd44 20+ customer traits that shake up every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd53 40+ delicious (and sometimes ridiculous) ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd57 Near-infinite recipe combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd51 Unlockable ingredients and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddc0 A shop to expand your culinary arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Multiple difficulties and starter ingredient sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become an overworked cafeteria lady? Alright then; omelet you cook.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205380?t=1744205177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205380?t=1744205177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/01bf082f8ebb8d58218a7f16479ec7b6a83939d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744205177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/01bf082f8ebb8d58218a7f16479ec7b6a83939d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744205177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3291300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Omelet You Cook</strong> is a  wacky arcade roguelike where your cooking skills are put to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/OmeletCycling.gif?t=1744205177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect omelet by combining ingredients to meet the ever-growing demands of quirky customers. Each round brings new challenges, hazards, restrictions, and ever-increasing score thresholds, that will push your culinary creativity to its limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/extras/cards-steam.png?t=1744205177\" />Every customer has a distinct personality and unique tastes, so you\u2019ll need to stay versatile and adjust your recipes on the fly. One minute you're crafting a classic bellpepper and bacon omelet, and the next you're tossing in donuts, pickles and pineapple. Keep your cool and keep those omelets coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Omelet You Cook is created by two indie devs and draws inspiration from beloved arcade roguelikes like <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Luck Be a Landlord</i>, and <i>Ballionaire</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feature List:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd44 20+ customer traits that shake up every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd53 40+ delicious (and sometimes ridiculous) ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd57 Near-infinite recipe combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd51 Unlockable ingredients and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddc0 A shop to expand your culinary arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Multiple difficulties and starter ingredient sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become an overworked cafeteria lady? Alright then; omelet you cook.</p>","developers":["Dan Schumacher","SchuBox Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205380/header.jpg?t=1744205177","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101550,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101550/movie480.mp4?t=1740373650","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101550/movie_max.mp4?t=1740373650"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101550/050d082ddaea731dc3aa9e5853d4f7beeb3e7712/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740373650","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101550/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740373650","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101550/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740373650"}}]